Prediction of Genetic Values of Quantitative Traits in Plant Breeding Using Pedigree and Molecular Markers, 
Genetics, Volume 186, Issue 2, 1 October 2010, Pages 713-724, 
\doi{10.1534/genetics.110.118521}
}
\keyword{datasets}
